@startuml cpu_timing_auto_reconnect
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title T-4: Auto-Reconnect FSM タイミング (5 回 backoff = 累計 ~25 秒)\n横軸: 秒 (s) / ADR-002 v1.1 で「逆効果」と判明

robust "tcp_server (FSM)" as TCP
robust "📷 camera_thread" as CAM
robust "🚚 usb_thread" as USB
robust "Health State" as HS
robust "PC viewer" as PC

@0
TCP is "CONNECTED" #LightGreen
CAM is "frame gen" #LightGreen
USB is "TCP send" #LightGreen
HS is HEALTHY
PC is "受信中"

@1
TCP is "BROKEN PIPE" #Pink
USB is "send err" #Pink
HS is CRITICAL
CAM is "frame → drop" #Pink
PC is "切断検知"

@2
TCP is "RECON(1) backoff 1s" #LightYellow
USB is "wait" #LightYellow
HS is RECONNECTING

@2
note bottom of TCP : reconnect_count=1 / backoff=1s

@3
TCP is "accept retry(1)" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : RST 受信 → 失敗

@4
TCP is "RECON(2) backoff 3s" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : reconnect_count=2 / backoff=3s

@7
TCP is "accept retry(2)" #LightYellow

@8
TCP is "成功 (一時)" #LightYellow
USB is "TCP send" #LightYellow
HS is CAUTION
PC is "再接続"

@9
TCP is "BROKEN PIPE" #Pink
USB is "send err" #Pink
HS is CRITICAL

@10
TCP is "RECON(3) backoff 5s" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : reconnect_count=3 / backoff=5s

@15
TCP is "accept retry(3)" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : RST 受信 → 失敗

@16
TCP is "RECON(4) backoff 7s" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : reconnect_count=4 / backoff=7s

@23
TCP is "accept retry(4)" #LightYellow
HS is FAILED
note bottom of TCP : 4 回目以降 RST 拒否頻発

@24
TCP is "RECON(5) backoff 9s" #LightYellow
note bottom of TCP : reconnect_count=5 / backoff=9s

@27
TCP is "FAILED 固着" #Pink
USB is "停止" #Pink
HS is FAILED
PC is "FAILED 表示"
note bottom of TCP : Max reconnect 達成 → 人手介入要 (RUNBOOK §4.3)

@30
TCP is "FAILED 固着" #Pink

highlight 1 to 27 #Pink : "Auto-Reconnect 中 (累計 ~25 秒)"
highlight 27 to 30 #Pink : "FAILED 状態固着"

legend bottom
  **ADR-002 v1.1 の「逆効果」を時間軸で説明**:

  • **設計目標 (ADR-002 v1.0)**: 切断 → 2.8 秒復旧 (90% 削減)
  • **実測 (Phase 9 / ADR-002 v1.1)**:
    - 1-3 回目で復旧する場合 ~5-10 秒
    - 4 回目以降 RST 拒否頻発 → FAILED 固着
    - PC FPS: 6.74 (Phase 8) → 2.77 (Phase 9, -59%) **悪化**
    - ドロップ率: 53.7% → 74.2% **悪化**

  • **悪化の原因**:
    1. 構造的天井 #1 (tx_buff[1]) で内部リソース未回復のまま再接続試行
    2. 再接続中も camera_thread は frame 生成 → action_queue overflow
    3. backoff 中の累計 ~25 秒は事実上サービス停止

  • **真の解決**:
    - 自動再接続戦略の見直し (max=5 → 3 程度に短縮 or 完全無効化)
    - Tier 移行 (構造的天井 #1 解消)

  関連:
  • RUNBOOK §3.4 (RECONNECTING 状態の確認)
  • RUNBOOK §4.3 (FAILED 状態からの復旧 = 人手介入)
  • FMEA B3 (RPN 300, 自動再接続による品質悪化)
endlegend

@enduml
